{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお昼過ぎに\n転校する前に通っていた高校の\n同級生と会いました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ち合わせをして～\n牛タンを食べて～\nお買い物して～\nメロンパンアイス食べて～\nまたお買い物して～\nDVD借りて～\n解散しました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにあって\nいろいろなお話を聞いて\nたのしかったな～！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その友達はブライダルのお仕事に\n就くことになったんだけど\n私と一緒に学校でお話してた時から\nずっと言ってた夢だから\nそれが叶って本当に嬉しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私ももっともっと頑張らないとって\n気合いがはいりました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、念願のメロンパンアイス！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当においしかった！\nまた絶対たべる！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/12/8540168/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/12/8540168/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/12/8540168/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまは、借りてきた\nファイディング・ニモをみてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なつかしい～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだね、ニモが学校に初めて\n登校して先生からどこに住んでるか聞かれて\nイソギンチャクがちゃんと言えなくて\nみんなに笑われてるところ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニモかわいいね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドリーはまだ映画館で観れてないから\nみにいきたいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/12/8540168/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば自分のお部屋に\n照明を買ったんだけど\nとてもいいかんじ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"間接照明っていいね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニモが人間に捕まって\n連れ去られて大変だから\nニモに集中します！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、またあした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/12/8540168/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/12/8540168/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みつあみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"反対からよんだら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みあつみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/12/8540168/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}